35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The receipts show transport is 38% of the cost if we go far.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,The inland clubs slept eight to a room. That explains the bad sleep.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,Cooking duty took two hours a day. That is too much work.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The public beds are 1,100 yen a night. That is cheaper than I thought.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The seniors say mixing only happens in the evenings when we sleep together.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Misaki, does the 1,100 yen include equipment?","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
