42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"Yes, but the lottery for public beds is very strict.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"Yes, hall and equipment are included in the 1,100 yen charge.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Takumi,,So we need a place where everyone sleeps together to mix.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The whole-building lets have non-refundable deposits. That is risky.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,The public centres have lights out at eleven. That is good for sleep.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,The application for public bookings is nine pages long.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I am glad the equipment is included. It saves money.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"If we go to a public centre, we might sleep together.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
